 "text": "AI Workflow Automation Platform - n8n\n\nMeet Nod, an open-source personal agent from n8n Labs.\n\nLearn more →\nn8n.io\nPRODUCT\nUSE CASES\nDOCS\nCOMMUNITY\nENTERPRISE\nPRICING\nSIGN IN\nGET STARTED\n\nSee llms.txt for all machine-readable content.\n\nBuild the agent. Understand its workflow.\nBuild the agent.\nUnderstand its workflow.\n\nn8n is the platform for agents and workflows you can follow. \nOpen any step, see what it does, and explain to anyone who runs it.\n\nGET STARTED\nTALK TO SALES\n\nRefund requested\nRefund requested\n\nLookup the order\nLookup the order\n\nInvestigate the claim\nInvestigate the claim\n\nParse the verdict\nParse the verdict\n\nAsk for approval on Slack\nAsk for approval on Slack\n\nApproved?\nApproved?\n\nProcess refund\nProcess refund\n\nOpen ticket\nOpen ticket\n\nConfirm to customer\nConfirm to customer\n\nRecord refund in database\nRecord refund in database\n\nClassify reason for refund\nClassify reason for refund\n\nRoute by reason\nRoute by reason\n\nGet order items\nGet order items\n\nEmail win-back discount\nEmail win-back discount\n\nQueue a return pickup\nQueue a return pickup\n\nFile QA ticket\nFile QA ticket\n\nMerge paths\nMerge paths\n\nAdd to the refunds report\nAdd to the refunds report\n\nPublish refund-closed event\nPublish refund-closed event\n\nClaude Sonnet 4.6\nClaude Sonnet 4.6\n\nRead the refund policy\nRead the refund policy\n\nCheck order history\nCheck order history\n\nRead past tickets\nRead past tickets\n\nTrack the delivery\nTrack the delivery\n\nCLICK HERE\n\nTrusted by Fortune 500 companies to build smarter workflows. \n\nTOM, IT\nCÉCILE, SECURITY\nKONSTI, DEVOPS\nALICIA, SALES\nHow Tom automated new user onboarding\n\nNew hires get instant access to Slack, Jira, Notion, and more, all in one workflow.\n\nSee how Tom did it\n\nTop 50 Github project with 210.3k stars\n\nRated 4.7/5 from real users on G2\n\nJoin 250k+ developers in our community\n\nThe USB-C for your AI stack\n\nConnect n8n to just about any tool you can think of. 500+ native integrations. \nAny API via HTTP. Any agent or coding assistant via MCP.\n\nSee + understand\n+ trust your agents\n\nConnect any model, see every decision, and add human approval when needed.\n\nFull visibility across agents \n\nWatch agents work live, or open any past run, all inside the same workflow.\n\nPut rules around AI actions\nSelf-host your AI stack\nBuilt by you +\nreadable by anyone\n\nCreate workflows anyone can follow with a visual builder and drop into code whenever you need it.\n\nDocumentation, built in\n\nThe workflow is the documentation. No separate docs. No handover write-ups.\n\nRecover in one step\nEvery change, tracked\nMove fast + \nbreak nothing\n\nShipped months ago. Still in control. \nFeels good, doesn't it?  \n\nMove fast. Replay a past run or mock the data. Skip waiting on external systems.  \nBreak nothing. See exactly what happened in the logs. No digging required. \n\nNow imagine that across your whole company. \n\nEnterprise-ready for teams \nof any size\n\nScale AI without losing control. Security, governance, and handoff built in.\n\nEXPLORE ENTERPRISE\nTALK TO SALES\nSecurity + control\n\nFully on-prem option, SSO SAML, and LDAP, encrypted secret stores, version control, RBAC permissions.\n\nObservability + transparency\n\nAudit logs and log streaming to your SIEM, workflow history, real-time alerts, usage dashboards.\n\nDeveloper experience\n\nGit-based control, isolated environments, multi-user workflows, workflow diffs.\n\nAI governance\n\nHuman-in-the-loop, guardrails, evaluations.\n\nCASE STUDY\nHUEL\nHuel saved 1,000 hours with an AI-first culture\n\n\"n8n was the big unlock. Tools like ChatGPT and Claude are great, but n8n is the thing that allows you to integrate AI into your work and your processes in a safe and controlled way.\"\n\nOllie Scheers\n\nChief Technology Officer\n\nREAD CASE STUDY\nCASE STUDY\nVODAFONE\nVodafone delivers £2.2M  security operations win\n\n\"n8n provides SOAR capability and workflows in a low-code model, as well as the ability to code for more complex workflows and integrations. It did everything that we wanted, all in one tool.\"\n\nClaire Van Hinsbergh\n\nCyber Operations Engineering Manager\n\nREAD CASE STUDY\n\nn8n makes complex workflows easy to build, and versatile enough for me to add my own 'secret sauce.'\n\nDANNY MELAMED\n\nI have found the holy grail of automation.\n\nLUISA VIDAL\n\nn8n’s integration with third-party services is absolutely mind-blowing. It’s like a Swiss army knife for automation.\n\nFELIX LEBER\n\nn8n is the tool that turns 'I have an idea' into 'it's running in production' faster than anything else.\n\nRIC NEVES\n\nAnything is possible with n8n. I think the cloud version is great, they are doing amazing stuff.\n\nROBYN TINDALL\n\nn8n’s integration with third-party services is absolutely mind-blowing. It’s like a Swiss army knife for automation.\n\nNANBING\n\nThank you to the n8n community. I did the beginners course and promptly took an automation WAY beyond my skill level.\n\nCHARLEY MANN\n\nI love the flexibility of n8n and how it lets different applications work together in a single workflow.\n\nRAY FOURIE\n\nn8n is the glue that holds many of our systems together.\n\nPAUL COOK\n\nI can move fast, go deep when things get complex, and never feel boxed in.\n\nALI MAZLOUM\nBuild workflows the way \nyou actually think\nSTART BUILDING\nn8n.io\nCAREERS\nHiring\nCONTACT\nPRESS\nBRAND GUIDELINES\nMERCH\nLEGAL\nEVENTS\nIN THE LOOP\nPARTNERS\nHIRE AN EXPERT\nAFFILIATE PROGRAM\nJOIN USER TESTS\nCASE STUDIES\nAI AGENT REPORT\nN8N ALTERNATIVES\nEDUCATION\nN8N ON SAP\nNOD\nLabs\nImprint\nSecurity\nPrivacy\nReport a vulnerability\nTwitter/X\nGitHub\nDiscord\nLinkedin\nyoutube\n© 2026 n8n\nAll rights reserved.\nThis website uses cookies\nWe use cookies to personalise content, ads and to analyse our traffic. We also share information about your use of our site with our advertising and analytics partners who may combine it with other information that you’ve provided to them or that they’ve collected from your use of their services. Read more\nEssential\nFunctional\nMarketing\nAccept all\nDecline all\nShow details",
